  "description": "State College proving curriculum for one coherent counterfactual PPO actor-critic. The 4x4 population-adaptive graph keeps the action problem observable while the learning contract is validated. Stage E learns candidate-conditioned interval dynamics; stages A and F use matched common-noise NMCC advantages inside the PPO clipped surrogate, and the ordinary critic supplies the NMCC endpoint continuation value. Reward is realized controllable hazard-weighted person-time plus potential-based reduction in forecast controllable evacuation debt. Panic and casualties remain reported outcomes, not direct learning terms.",
